Z||000002||Carrolles||10-16-2001||09:07 AM||||I don't think jerkyness would be caused by a standard transmission.  A clutch could definately cause it as well as bad motor mounts.<P>Does the car seem to have reasonable power when it is not bucking?  Have you checked timing, plugs, wires, etc?  Weak ignition could cause bucking under load.<P>Good luck,<P>Carroll||||reg||1
